rk must pay the price for each step... And not everyone makes it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779100/extras/d9bea4bccba21126888ae5fb38c3e368.poster.avif?t=1750412746\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779100/extras/d9bea4bccba21126888ae5fb38c3e368.webm?t=1750412746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3779100/extras/d9bea4bccba21126888ae5fb38c3e368.mp4?t=1750412746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
